// Sacrifice / Martyr's Reckoning (PA_SACRIFICE): the reference EF_BASH3D tints
// the caster light red with a doubled-body halo for 0.15..0.45s, and at 0.2s
// throws two flat bursts of rays out from the body. Here a light red halo
// pulse, a soft red core, and two staggered rings of pale red streaks
// radiating outward. ~0.6s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the caster's feet,
// smaller y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. Rays radiate from the body
// center at (319, 236).
